ion":"Set a goal — keep working until the condition is met","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"design-consent","description":"Grant Claude agent access to your Design projects","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"design-revoke","description":"Revoke Claude agent access to your Design projects","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"list-agents","description":"List subagents, teammates, and other Claude sessions you can message","argumentHint":"","aliases":["peers"],"builtin":true},{"name":"team-onboarding","description":"Help teammates ramp on Claude Code with a guide from your usage","argumentHint":"","builtin":true},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:automate_client_monthly_reports (MCP)","description":"Create a monthly SEO performance report for a client domain including organic traffic changes, top 10 performing keywords, ranking improvements vs last month, and a comparison against a competitor domain, formatted as an executive summary suitable for client presentation","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:build_a_serp_aligned_content_brief (MCP)","description":"Analyze the top-ranking pages for a target keyword in a given country and build a content brief covering search intent, common sections to include, and must-cover subtopics","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:build_executive_seo_snapshot (MCP)","description":"Generate an executive summary for a domain over a given period, highlighting overall performance, top winning pages, and top losing pages","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:cluster_search_demand_by_volume (MCP)","description":"Identify the top keyword clusters for a topic or niche in a given country, ranked by combined monthly search volume, with example keywords for each cluster","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:compare_against_one_competitor (MCP)","description":"For a Position Tracking project in Semrush, compare your positions against one competitor domain for the tracked keywords, and show 