n":"Find pages on a domain that have zero keywords ranking in the top 100 search results, so you can decide whether to delete, redirect, or noindex them (needs Site Audit set up for full page coverage)","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:generate_structured_data_checklist (MCP)","description":"Generate a structured data (schema markup) checklist for a product or category page URL, covering required fields and common mistakes to avoid","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:generate_weekly_intelligence_brief (MCP)","description":"Generate a weekly intelligence brief comparing your domain to competitor domains, summarizing organic growth, top traffic sources, key drivers, and implications for SEO, marketing, and product teams","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:identify_pages_to_defend (MCP)","description":"Identify a domain's highest-value pages by organic traffic, so you know which pages to protect most closely from competitor attacks","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:identify_quick_win_content_updates (MCP)","description":"Analyze a domain's organic keywords and suggest content topics where rankings are between positions 8–20 and could realistically reach the top 5","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:monitor_seo_performance_over_time (MCP)","description":"Compare a domain's organic traffic, keyword count, and visibility over a given number of months to the previous period, and flag any significant changes","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:run_a_site_health_check (MCP)","description":"Check the Site Audit for a Semrush project and summarize the top technical issues by severity, along with the pages most affected (needs Site Audit set up for that project in the Semrush UI)","argumentHint":""},{"name":"claude.ai Semrush:see_top_landing_pages (MCP)","description":"For a Position Tracking project in Semrush, show the landing pages with the most tracked keywords and their average position (needs Position T