{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgVG1heCiNHdPhcdEkmzK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've written `/work/output.csv` with 124 rows, covering 120 of the 138 documents. I left `/work/inputs` unchanged.\n\n**What I left out (18 documents):**\n- **10 that aren't invoices or credit notes:** purchase orders (doc_006, 024, 047), payment receipts (057, 072), remittance advice (007, 068) and quotes (071, 101, 126).\n- **8 copies of invoices already listed:** doc_003, 030, 034, 039, 049, 054, 099 and 124. Each time I kept the original invoice and dropped the marked \"DUPLICATE COPY\" or \"RESENT\" version.\n\n**How the rest breaks down:**\n- **Account statements:** doc_033 (Orbit Courier Group) and doc_108 (Harbor Line Logistics Ltd) each list three invoices, so each gives three rows under the statement's file name.\n- **Credit notes:** there are 7, with negative amounts. Where the tax is zero, I wrote `0.00` rather than `-0.00`.\n- **Forwarded emails:** each was included as an invoice, with its figures taken from the email text.\n- **Invoices with a payment deducted:** the \"Remit to: Capital Factoring Services\" invoices list the supplier as vendor, not the factoring company. The total is the invoice total before the payment, not the balance due.\n- **Two-page invoices:** page 2 shows only \"Carried forward\" before tax, so I used that figure as the subtotal.\n- **Dates:** US numeric dates are read month-first. UK, German, French and Dutch numeric dates are read day-first.\n- **Blank fields:** where a document has no due date, I left it empty.\n\n**6 invoices need review (subtotal plus tax doesn't equal the printed total):**\n\n| File | Invoice | Vendor | Subtotal + tax | Printed total |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| doc_076 | SI-92854 | Orbit Courier Group | 10,926.43 | 11,926.43 |\n| doc_078 | SI-26138 | Lumen Print Studio SARL | 7,065.58 | 7,055.58 |\n| doc_091 | A-45885 | Nordlicht Software GmbH | 20,428.55 | 20,437.55 |\n| doc_098 | BW-50851 | Northgate Office Partners Ltd | 20,902.00 | 21,902.00 |\n| doc_111 | BW-30118 | Redfern IT Services | 326.13 | 335.13 |\n| doc_137 | SI-31487 | Nordlicht Software GmbH | 9,469.86 | 10,469.86 |\n\n**Checks and judgement calls:**\n- **Checks:** I typed the rows by hand from the documents. A script then confirmed that every invoice number, vendor name and amount in the file appears in its source document. It also confirmed that no invoice is listed twice.\n- **Vendor capitalisation:** some headers are printed in capitals, such as \"HARBOR LINE LOGISTICS LTD\". I used the mixed-case name the same company prints elsewhere.\n- **Same amounts, different numbers:** BW-15827 on the doc_108 statement (Harbor Line) has almost the same amounts as invoice BW-98975 in doc_096 (Copperleaf). They have different numbers and vendors, so I listed both."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":470,"cache_read_input_tokens":64200,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":470},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9336d676-312d-4cc2-956f-913b25adbdce","uuid":"a4219213-c85d-4ac1-a517-bc57bee29530","timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:23:32.753Z","request_id":"req_011CgVG1hMaMTnA7rFfwZnoh"}
